            # In captures for 'z', stdout is banner_text + '\n' (123). banner_text itself length 122? our function includes trailing \n after line = 3 lines including first blank. Original 123 includes an extra newline. Wait banner_text gives "\n...\n...\n" length122; original banner-only output is 123 with '\n' at end. We'll generally let operations print banner_text() then they print "\nScanning..." which yields blank line. For error case, we add '\n'.
            S.err(f"\n\nCommand Line Error:\n{e.msg}\n")
